        "text": "Analyze this receipt image and extract the receipt information.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"merchant_name\": \"\",\n  \"transaction_date\": \"\",\n  \"total_amount\": null,\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"receipt_number\": \"\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- merchant_name: business or store name.\n- transaction_date: use YYYY-MM-DD format.\n- total_amount: numeric value only, without currency symbols or commas.\n- currency: use ISO currency code such as PHP, USD, EUR.\n- receipt_number: receipt, invoice, OR number if visible; otherwise null.\n- payment_method: cash, credit card, debit card, e-wallet, or other if visible; otherwise null.\n- Do not guess values that are not visible.\n- For unavailable fields, return null.\n- Do not include Markdown.\n- Do not wrap the response in ```json.\n- Return only the JSON object.",
